<title>CANADA: Hydro-Quebec names new chairman.</title>
<headline>Hydro-Quebec names new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>QUEBEC CITY, Quebec</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Quebec government said Wednesday it named Gaz Metropolitain &amp; Co. LP Chief Executive Andre Caille as chairman of the provincially-owned utility giant.</p>
<p>The announcement followed the September firing of Yvon Martineau as chairman. His departure had been rumoured since last spring because of executive disputes and a power struggle with Quebec Energy Minister Guy Chevrette.</p>
<p>Hydro recently named Jean-Andre Elie as interim chairman.</p>
